      "en": "A free interactive Grade 1 grammar activity: at Hattie's Lost-and-Found Hat Shop, every character needs the right word-hat for its job in the sentence — he when doing, him when it is done to him, his when it belongs to him. Read the sentence, then pick the pronoun that fits. A friendly first look at using pronouns correctly. Common Core L.1.1.d.",
